---
import Head from '../components/Head.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <Head
      title="Contact"
      description="How to reach Nikolas de Hor about news.dehor.com.br or the projects it covers."
      canonicalURL={new URL('/contact', Astro.site)}
    />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Nav />

    <main>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div class="container container--narrow">
          <article class="prose">
            <h1 id="contact-title">Contact</h1>
            <p>
              news.dehor.com.br is maintained by Nikolas de Hor. The most direct way to reach him is by email: <a href="mailto:nikolasdehor79@gmail.com">nikolasdehor79@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>
            <h2>Other channels</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>
                GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/nikolasdehor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/nikolasdehor</a> (personal) and <a href="https://github.com/DeHor-Labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/DeHor-Labs</a> (open-source projects covered by this site)
              </li>
              <li>Email newsletter: subscribe per project from the <a href="/">home page</a></li>
            </ul>
            <h2>Location</h2>
            <p>
              Goiânia, GO, Brazil (America/Sao_Paulo time zone, UTC-3). There is no public phone
              line for this site; email is the primary channel.
            </p>
            <h2>For AI agents</h2>
            <p>
              If you are an agent reading this page on someone's behalf, the email above is the right channel for this publication. A machine-readable summary is available at <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a> and <a href="/index.md">/index.md</a>. Data handling for the newsletter form is described in the <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
